<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AutoCare Manager — Smart Vehicle Service &amp; Workshop Operations</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <style>
        .landing-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1329 0%, #111c38 60%, #0f244a 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 56px 48px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px -15px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
        }
        .landing-hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -120px;
            right: -120px;
            width: 360px;
            height: 360px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18) 0%, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0) 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .landing-hero-content {
            max-width: 820px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .landing-hero h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 16px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #cbd5e1 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .landing-hero p {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .portal-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(360px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .portal-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px 28px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .portal-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-color: var(--brand-primary);
        }
        .portal-card.portal-admin:hover {
            border-color: #f59e0b;
        }
        .portal-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .portal-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .portal-owner .portal-icon {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            color: #0284c7;
        }
        .portal-admin .portal-icon {
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #d97706;
        }
        .portal-title h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-headline);
            margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        }
        .portal-title span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .portal-features {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 28px 0;
        }
        .portal-features li {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 8px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .portal-features li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .portal-features svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .portal-owner .portal-features svg {
            color: #0284c7;
        }
        .portal-admin .portal-features svg {
            color: #d97706;
        }
        .demo-bar {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .features-section {
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }
        .feature-box {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .feature-box h4 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 12px 0 8px 0;
            color: var(--text-headline);
        }
        .feature-box p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .live-db-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
            color: #059669;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
        }
        .pulse-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #10b981;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7);
            animation: pulse-animation 1.8s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse-animation {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7); }
            70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(16, 185, 129, 0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Main Navigation Header -->
    <header class="site-nav">
        <div class="nav-inner">
            <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
                <div class="brand-badge">
                    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.5 2.8C2.1 11.2 2 11.6 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2"/>
                        <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/>
                        <path d="M9 17h6"/>
                        <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="brand-text">
                    <h1>AutoCare Manager</h1>
                    <span>Fleet &amp; Service Operations</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <nav class="nav-menu">
                <a href="#portals" class="nav-link">Portals</a>
                <a href="#features" class="nav-link">Features</a>
                <a href="/login" class="nav-link">Sign In</a>
                <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="margin-left: 8px;">Create Account</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main-wrapper">

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="landing-hero">
            <div class="landing-hero-content">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <div class="hero-pill">
                        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg>
                        AUTOMOTIVE SERVICE PLATFORM &bull; PS 5
                    </div>
                    <div class="live-db-badge">
                        <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
                        MongoDB Atlas Cloud Connected
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h1>Smart Vehicle Service &amp; Workshop Operations</h1>
                <p>A unified dual-role management platform. Vehicle owners register cars, receive automated mileage and date maintenance reminders, and book service visits. Service centers triage requests, record parts replaced, and track workshop financials.</p>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="#portals" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 15px;">
                        Explore Portals
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 15px;">
                        Sign In
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- Designated Portals Grid -->
        <div id="portals" class="section-title-group" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div>
                <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: 22px;">Designated User Portals</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 4px 0 0 0;">Dedicated environments built specifically for Vehicle Owners and Service Center Admins.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="portal-grid">

            <!-- Portal 1: Vehicle Owner -->
            <div class="portal-card portal-owner">
                <div>
                    <div class="portal-header">
                        <div class="portal-icon">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.5 2.8C2.1 11.2 2 11.6 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2"/>
                                <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/>
                                <path d="M9 17h6"/>
                                <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="portal-title">
                            <h3>Vehicle Owner Portal</h3>
                            <span>For Car &amp; Bike Owners</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        Manage your personal fleet, book workshop service appointments, report mechanical problems, and track maintenance expenditures.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="portal-features">
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Register Vehicles:</strong> Number, model, purchase date &amp; mileage</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Automated Reminders:</strong> Alerts when &ge; 10,000 km or 6 months due</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Book Service &amp; Report Problems:</strong> Describe issues directly</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Per-Vehicle Ledger:</strong> Track past work and maintenance costs</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                    <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="flex: 1; text-align: center; justify-content: center;">
                        Sign In as Owner
                    </a>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color: #0284c7; color: #0284c7; text-align: center; justify-content: center;">
                        Register
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Portal 2: Service Center / Admin -->
            <div class="portal-card portal-admin">
                <div>
                    <div class="portal-header">
                        <div class="portal-icon">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="portal-title">
                            <h3>Service Center Desk</h3>
                            <span>For Workshop &amp; Fleet Admins</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                        Control workshop floor operations, review incoming customer requests, assign active service bays, and invoice replaced parts and costs.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="portal-features">
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Triage Desk:</strong> Review and 1-click Accept or Reject requests</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Repair Bay Manager:</strong> Monitor vehicles currently in service</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Job Sheets:</strong> Record parts replaced, mechanic notes &amp; costs</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                            <span><strong>Revenue Analytics:</strong> Track total workshop billings in real-time</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                    <a href="/login" class="btn" style="flex: 1; text-align: center; justify-content: center; background: #d97706; color: white; border: none;">
                        Sign In as Workshop Admin
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Core Features Section -->
        <div id="features" class="features-section">
            <div class="section-title-group">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size: 22px;">System Capabilities &amp; Architecture</h3>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 4px 0 0 0;">Engineered strictly using Semester 2 &amp; 3 curriculum patterns (Node.js, Express, MongoDB Atlas, EJS).</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div style="color: #0284c7; font-size: 22px;">⏰</div>
                    <h4>Service Reminders (Stretch Goal)</h4>
                    <p>Calculates maintenance due intervals automatically whenever a vehicle reaches &ge; 10,000 km or 6 months from purchase date.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div style="color: #d97706; font-size: 22px;">📋</div>
                    <h4>Triage Desk Workflow</h4>
                    <p>Incoming bookings start in <code>Pending</code> status, allowing workshop technicians to review problem reports and triage with <code>Accepted</code> or <code>Rejected</code>.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div style="color: #10b981; font-size: 22px;">🔧</div>
                    <h4>Parts Replaced &amp; Billing</h4>
                    <p>Record itemized spare parts (e.g. ceramic brake pads, synthetic engine oil) and final labor costs into an immutable service record.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-box">
                    <div style="color: #8b5cf6; font-size: 22px;">☁️</div>
                    <h4>Real Cloud Database</h4>
                    <p>Zero mock data. Connected to live MongoDB Atlas cluster <code>vehicleServiceDB</code> storing users, vehicles, and real service jobs.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="background: #0b1329; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: 32px 24px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="font-weight: 700; color: white;">AutoCare Manager</span>
                <span>&bull; PS 5 Vehicle Service &amp; Maintenance Management System</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
                <a href="/login" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none;">Sign In</a>
                <a href="/register" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none;">Create Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
